WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.830
FedRAMP standardizes cloud security assessment, authorization,

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:06.965
and continuous monitoring for cloud services used by federal agencies.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:11.970
The program is built on NIST guidance, especially NIST SP 800-53 security controls.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:16.880
FedRAMP supports secure cloud adoption by improving consistency, reuse of evidence,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.165
risk visibility, and ongoing monitoring.

00:00:19.165 --> 00:00:23.550
Strong FedRAMP programs depend on governance, technical controls, documentation,

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.990
assessment, continuous monitoring, shared responsibility, and continuous improvement.
